OL,3,GNEWSAVisitor levy 'wrong tax at wrong
OL,4,Atime' says tourist board
OL,5,
OL,6,FImposing a tourist tax in Surrey would
OL,7,Fbe "the wrong tax, at the wrong time",
OL,8,Fthe chair of the county's official
OL,9,Ftourist board has said.
OL,11,FMayors in England are to be given the
OL,12,Fpower to introduce an overnight visitor
OL,13,Flevy on tourists, under plans announced
OL,14,Fby the government on Thursday.
OL,16,FSurrey will be unaffected by the recent
OL,17,Fdecision to pause restructuring plans
OL,18,Ffor more than a dozen authorities,
OL,19,Fmeaning a mayor could one day preside
OL,20,Fover East and West Surrey, the two new
OL,21,Funitary councils being created next
OL,22,Fyear.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
