OL,3,GNEWSAVisitor levy 'wrong tax at wrong
OL,4,Atime' says tourist board
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Howard, chair of Visit Surrey,
OL,7,Ftold BBC Radio Surrey: "We're not a big
OL,8,Foverseas tourism destination, it's
OL,9,Flocal people - it's going to be another
OL,10,Ftax on local people."
